    {
      "id": "RTwJjKLOq-gA8z_DZObQ1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 406.2484835893591,
      "y": 1623.6797484866393,
      "width": 190.76792907714844,
      "height": 170.02646756694418,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 105783766,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 2120667786,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781554433944,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** Data model **\n-- Post entities\n-- User entities\n-- Feed entities\n\n",
      "fontSize": 22.670195675592556,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Data model **\n-- Post entities\n-- User entities\n-- Feed entities\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "shh4mD-hk4gh24qa8-57P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 713.7023653090121,
      "y": 1626.056816060015,
      "width": 1061.215087890625,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2066720150,
      "version": 430,
      "versionNonce": 529115990,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781555067075,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** Normalization **\nEntities should live in a normalized client store where each unique entity is stored exactly once and relationship are represented by IDs\nrather than nested copies.\n-- Main feed can be stored as one ordered list of post IDs while post detail views, comments and other feed-like surface can reference\nthe same canonical post, user, media records\n\ntype Media = {\n  id: string;\n  src: string;\n  previewSrc?: string;\n  alt: string;\n  width: number;\n  height: number;\n};\n\ntype ComposerDraft = {\n  body: PostBody;\n  mediaIds: string[];\n  uploadState: 'idle' | 'uploading' | 'failed';\n  submitState: 'idle' | 'submitting' | 'submitted' | 'failed';\n};\n\ntype Store = {\n  feedsById: Record<string, Feed>;\n  postsById: Record<string, Post>;\n  usersById: Record<string, User>;\n  mediaById: Record<string, Media>;\n  composerDraft: ComposerDraft;\n};\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Normalization **\nEntities should live in a normalized client store where each unique entity is stored exactly once and relationship are represented by IDs\nrather than nested copies.\n-- Main feed can be stored as one ordered list of post IDs while post detail views, comments and other feed-like surface can reference\nthe same canonical post, user, media records\n\ntype Media = {\n  id: string;\n  src: string;\n  previewSrc?: string;\n  alt: string;\n  width: number;\n  height: number;\n};\n\ntype ComposerDraft = {\n  body: PostBody;\n  mediaIds: string[];\n  uploadState: 'idle' | 'uploading' | 'failed';\n  submitState: 'idle' | 'submitting' | 'submitted' | 'failed';\n};\n\ntype Store = {\n  feedsById: Record<string, Feed>;\n  postsById: Record<string, Post>;\n  usersById: Record<string, User>;\n  mediaById: Record<string, Media>;\n  composerDraft: ComposerDraft;\n};\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
