    {
      "id": "C7zvS503DIvq-fcuXpUy8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 890.3918782911984,
      "y": 6972.439762532154,
      "width": 795.2394409179688,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1829079126,
      "version": 895,
      "versionNonce": 1175066454,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781631281057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Seperate image:\n   Pros: simple to implement\n   Cons: multiple donwload request per images\n2. Sprite:\n   Pros: One HTTP request to download all icon images\n   Cons: Complicated to set up.\n3. Icon fonts\n   Pros: scalable and crisp\n   Cons: Glyphs are rendered as text character, which can confuse screen reader, \n   and affected by text styling override, FOUT or FOIT while the font load\n4. SVG\n   Pros: scalable and crisp, cachable\n   Cons: flickering when file is being downloaded, one download request per image\n5. Inline SVG (Facebook and Twitter use this)\n   Pros: Scalable and crisp\n   Cons: not cachable indepently, repeat will inflate HTML/JS page load\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Seperate image:\n   Pros: simple to implement\n   Cons: multiple donwload request per images\n2. Sprite:\n   Pros: One HTTP request to download all icon images\n   Cons: Complicated to set up.\n3. Icon fonts\n   Pros: scalable and crisp\n   Cons: Glyphs are rendered as text character, which can confuse screen reader, \n   and affected by text styling override, FOUT or FOIT while the font load\n4. SVG\n   Pros: scalable and crisp, cachable\n   Cons: flickering when file is being downloaded, one download request per image\n5. Inline SVG (Facebook and Twitter use this)\n   Pros: Scalable and crisp\n   Cons: not cachable indepently, repeat will inflate HTML/JS page load\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aAGevyXJxMgzDXCG79Ho-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 213.62641197142506,
      "y": 7569.342724698129,
      "width": 923.9594116210938,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
