      "seed": 1417825110,
      "version": 9,
      "versionNonce": 1973491030,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781631329601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*  The standard pattern is an outbox: when the composer submits, \nthe data access layer writes the pending mutation to IndexedDB keyed by its idempotency key, \napplies the optimistic update to the store, and fires the network request. \nIf the request succeeds, the outbox entry is dropped. \nIf it fails, it stays in the outbox and is retried.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*  The standard pattern is an outbox: when the composer submits, \nthe data access layer writes the pending mutation to IndexedDB keyed by its idempotency key, \napplies the optimistic update to the store, and fires the network request. \nIf the request succeeds, the outbox entry is dropped. \nIf it fails, it stays in the outbox and is retried.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G0yW37NZBY2B2V2p1me1D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210.9247534232427,
      "y": 7666.602432432711,
      "width": 650.7794799804688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 493276438,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1149893078,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781631375492,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--- Retry strategy (combine request duplication, idempotency keys)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--- Retry strategy (combine request duplication, idempotency keys)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2INVUYFa_LXyBG20BTARq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 182.55733866732402,
      "y": 8471.696679791165,
      "width": 858.159423828125,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 22481610,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 1025485322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781631689351,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Live update (for feed comment implementation)\n--- Short polling\n--- Long polling\n--- SSE (Server sent event)\n--- Websocket\n===> For high-traffic posts (celebrities, politicians, breaking news), \ndowngrade to count-only updates. \nPushing every event for every loaded post wastes both client CPU and server fan-out, \nand individual comment-level updates become unreadable on hot posts anyway.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Live update (for feed comment implementation)\n--- Short polling\n--- Long polling\n--- SSE (Server sent event)\n--- Websocket\n===> For high-traffic posts (celebrities, politicians, breaking news), \ndowngrade to count-only updates. \nPushing every event for every loaded post wastes both client CPU and server fan-out, \nand individual comment-level updates become unreadable on hot posts anyway.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AIALErmfO7EOrRYmTYBNe",
      "type": "text",
